      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Live GPS‑Enabled Doorstep Pickup &amp; Delivery for Bike Transport in Revelganj</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">In Revelganj, the **doorstep bike pickup and delivery workflow** has become a model of speed and reliability. A customer first logs into the mobile app, selects “Bike Pickup,” and enters the pick‑up and drop‑off addresses. The scheduling engine instantly proposes the nearest available courier, taking into account real‑time traffic data and current workload. Once the customer confirms the slot, the system sends an automatic SMS and push notification confirming the date, time, and courier details.

When the courier arrives, a two‑step verification process kicks in. First, the rider scans the customer’s QR‑coded receipt on the phone, which triggers a voice‑to‑text confirmation. Next, a quick selfie is taken and matched against the customer’s ID photo stored in the system, ensuring that the package is handed to the rightful recipient. This dual verification not only protects against theft but also builds trust in the service.

Live GPS tracking is the backbone of the experience. As soon as the bike departs, the rider’s GPS feed is streamed to the customer’s app. The customer can watch the bike’s progress on a map, receive estimated arrival times, and get instant alerts if the courier deviates from the planned route. The same feed is available to the dispatcher, who can re‑route the bike in real time if a traffic jam or accident occurs.

Communication remains seamless throughout. The app pushes proactive updates: “Your bike is 5 minutes away,” “Courier is en route,” and “Package delivered.” If the customer has any questions, an in‑app chat connects them directly to the rider or customer support. After delivery, the rider scans the package’s QR code again, and the system logs the completion timestamp, triggering a satisfaction survey.

**Key Steps in the Workflow**

1. Customer places order via app  
2. Scheduling engine matches nearest courier  
3. Courier arrival → QR scan + selfie verification  
4. Live GPS feed displayed to customer & dispatcher  
5. Real‑time updates sent through push notifications  
6. Delivery confirmation & post‑delivery survey

By weaving together scheduling, verification, live GPS tracking, and continuous customer communication, Revelganj’s doorstep bike pickup and delivery workflow delivers not just packages, but confidence and convenience to every rider.</div>
