<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transportation in Revelganj | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure my bike arrives without scratches during the Revelganj to hub transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every bike is loaded onto our hydraulic ramp trailers using a dedicated cradle that holds the frame securely. The seven‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging wraps the bike, while the enclosed container truck shields it from external impacts. Real‑time GPS monitoring and a zero‑scratch guarantee mean any deviation triggers immediate corrective action, ensuring the bike reaches the destination pristine.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for GST‑compliant bike parcel service in Revelganj?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Clients must provide a valid GSTIN, a signed e‑Way bill, the original purchase invoice of the bike, and a government‑issued ID for verification. Our IBA‑approved invoice includes all taxable details, enabling seamless reimbursement for corporate or government transfers. A copy of the insurance policy and a signed consent form complete the paperwork.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time while it’s on the highway from Revelganj?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Each container truck is equipped with satellite GPS that streams live location data to our customer portal. You receive a unique tracking link that updates every few minutes, showing exact position, speed, and estimated arrival time. Alerts are sent for any unscheduled stops, giving you full visibility throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for bike transportation, and what does the IRDAI policy cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While optional, we strongly recommend the IRDAI‑approved full‑coverage insurance for peace of mind. The policy covers accidental damage, theft, natural calamities, and transit‑related losses up to the declared value of the bike. In the unlikely event of a claim, our dedicated team handles documentation and settlement within 7‑10 business days.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading system work for sports and cruiser bikes?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp lowers smoothly onto the loading dock, aligning with the bike’s rear wheel. Technicians secure the bike using high‑tensile ratchet lashings and wheel chocks, then slide it onto a custom cradle that matches the bike’s geometry. This method eliminates manual lifting, reduces stress on the frame, and guarantees a scratch‑free load for both sports and cruiser models.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any restrictions on bike size or type for the Revelganj parcel service?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our fleet accommodates standard motorcycles, scooters, cruisers, and sport bikes up to 2.2 meters in length and 180 kg in weight. Oversized or custom‑built bikes may require a dedicated trailer, which we can arrange at an additional cost. All vehicles must be road‑worthy, with a valid registration and no visible structural damage.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the quoted price compare with train bike transport or bus parcel options?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our quote includes door‑to‑door service, seven‑layer packaging, live GPS tracking, and full insurance—features often excluded from train or bus parcel rates. While rail and bus may appear cheaper on paper, hidden fees for handling, insurance, and last‑mile delivery can raise total costs. Shree Ashirwad offers a transparent, all‑inclusive price that eliminates surprise charges.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
